# Chercan Crawl4AI Project Rules

## Project Structure
- Follow modular architecture with clear separation of concerns
- Use @tasks.md for tracking progress and marking tasks as [DONE]
- @project_specs.md contains detailed requirements and objectives

## Code Standards
- Use Python type hints everywhere
- Follow PEP 8 style guidelines
- All classes should have docstrings with parameters and return values
- Create unit tests for all components

## Development Guidelines
- Implement core components first following @tasks.md sequence
- Use async/await for all I/O operations
- Create factory patterns for all strategy implementations
- Handle errors gracefully with custom exception classes

## Crawl4AI Integration
- Import Crawl4AI v0.5.0 and utilize its core components:
  - AsyncWebCrawler for high-performance crawling
  - BrowserConfig and CrawlerRunConfig for configuration
  - Multiple crawler strategies (browser-based and HTTP-only)
  - Deep crawling with configurable strategies (BFS, DFS, Best-First)
  - LLMConfig system for unified LLM provider configuration
  - LLMContentFilter for high-quality markdown generation

## Architecture
- /crawl4ai - Main package
  - /core - Base classes and utilities
  - /config - Configuration handling
  - /crawlers - Different crawler implementations
  - /strategies - Crawling strategies (BFS, DFS, Best-First)
  - /processing - Data extraction and filtering
    - /extractors - CSS, XPath, and LLM-based extractors
    - /filters - Content filtering implementations
  - /exports - Export formats (Markdown, JSON, CSV)
  - /api - API endpoints
  - /cli - Command-line interface
  - /utils - Shared utilities
  - /docker - Docker deployment configurations

## Installation Process
- Run setup_project.py to initialize project structure
- Use Python virtual environment for development
- Install Crawl4AI with: `pip install crawl4ai`
- Run post-installation: `crawl4ai-setup` and `crawl4ai-doctor`

## Testing & Validation
- Test on multiple websites and scenarios
- Validate memory usage and performance
- Ensure all exported data is properly formatted
- Verify compatibility with different environments
- Create example implementations for e-commerce, news, and social media